Date: 2026-11-23. Run by: the reviewer (Claude Code session).
The commit was built in a temporary worktree (git worktree add --detach), removed after.
Every probe ran in a new scratch git project with HANDOFF_TEST_NOTIFY set and the session
variables unset. Sessions are simulated: CLAUDE_CODE_SESSION_ID with CLAUDE_PID (the pid of
a sleep, killed to end "the process") for Claude Code; ANTIGRAVITY_CONVERSATION_ID or the
hook's stdin for Antigravity. quiet_after is 4 s in the scratch configs, so twice it is 8 s.
The operator's commands run at a pty (atterm.py), which answers each [y/N] in turn.

Verdict: CHANGES.

